<p id="S1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We suspect that the techniques developed here should be implementable to obtain new lower bound constructions for small van der Waerden numbers with at least three colors. See the Wikipedia page <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">33</a>]</cite> for current known lower bounds.</p>
